  "id": "independent-living",
  "term": "independent living",
  "definition": "Independent living is the ability to live as an adult with autonomy rather than depending mainly on family caregivers or institutional settings. In this context, it is described as a fundamental right, though achieving it can be limited by clinical complexity and structural barriers that affect quality of life.",
